==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Surging Sparks|Magnemite|58}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Surging Sparks}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Magnemite|58}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magnemite|60}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare card features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Magnemite}}.
*'''Lightning Ball''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Lanturn|20}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

